{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21949","headline":"春雪 · 白居易","name":"春雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元和岁在卯，六年春二月。\n月晦寒食天，天阴夜飞雪。\n连宵复竟日，浩浩殊未歇。\n大似落鹅毛，密如飘玉屑。\n寒销春茫苍，气变风凛冽。\n上林草尽没，曲江水复结。\n红乾杏花死，绿冻杨枝折。\n所怜物性伤，非惜年芳绝。\n上天有时令，四序平分别。\n寒燠苟反常，物生皆夭阏。\n我观圣人意，鲁史有其说。\n或记水不冰，或书霜不杀。\n上将儆政教，下以防灾孽。\n兹雪今如何，信美非时节。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}